{
  "name": "02 - Webhook Validation → Google Sheets + Slack (with Daily Digest)",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## A. Real-time ingest\n\nAny system (payment provider, e-commerce platform, internal app) POSTs an *order event* here.\n\n**Set → Map Fields** isolates the fields we care about so the rest of the flow never depends on the sender's exact payload shape.\n\n**Code → Validate** checks required fields and types, and builds a deterministic `dedupeKey` (`source:event_id`). Keys seen in the last 5 000 events are rejected as duplicates.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Note: Ingest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## B. Valid → persist + notify\n\nValid events are appended to the **Events** sheet and announced in Slack `#orders`. The sender gets **200**.\n\n## C. Invalid → alert ops\n\nInvalid events are *not* stored. Slack `#ops` receives the error list and the raw payload; the sender gets **422** with the same errors so they can fix their integration.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
      "name": "Note: Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## D. Daily digest (08:00)\n\nA second trigger in the same workflow reads the **Events** sheet every morning, keeps only yesterday's rows (`received_at` starts with yesterday's date), aggregates count / total amount / breakdown by source, and posts a summary to Slack `#orders`.\n\n*Filter* has **Always Output Data** enabled so the digest is posted even on a day with zero events.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000103",
      "name": "Note: Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 560]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "order-events",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Order Event Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [80, 120],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "s2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "event_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.event_id ?? $json.body.id ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "source",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.source ?? $json.headers['x-source'] ?? 'unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "customer_email",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.customer_email ?? $json.body.email ?? '').toString().trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "amount",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.amount ?? null }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
              "name": "currency",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.currency ?? 'USD').toString().toUpperCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body.status ?? '').toString().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
              "name": "received_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
              "name": "raw",
              "value": "={{ $json.body }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {
          "ignoreConversionErrors": true
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Map Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [300, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validate the mapped event: required fields, types, allowed values, dedupe.\nconst REQUIRED = ['event_id', 'source', 'customer_email', 'amount', 'currency', 'status'];\nconst ALLOWED_STATUS = ['created', 'paid', 'refunded', 'cancelled'];\nconst ALLOWED_CURRENCY = ['USD', 'EUR', 'GBP', 'ARS', 'BRL', 'MXN'];\nconst EMAIL_RE = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]{2,}$/;\nconst MAX_SEEN = 5000;\n\n// Static data survives between production executions (not in manual test runs).\nconst store = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstore.seenKeys = Array.isArray(store.seenKeys) ? store.seenKeys : [];\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => {\n  const e = item.json;\n  const errors = [];\n\n  for (const f of REQUIRED) {\n    const v = e[f];\n    if (v === undefined || v === null || v === '') errors.push(`${f} is required`);\n  }\n\n  if (e.amount !== null && e.amount !== undefined) {\n    if (typeof e.amount !== 'number' || Number.isNaN(e.amount)) errors.push('amount must be a number');\n    else if (e.amount < 0) errors.push('amount must be >= 0');\n  }\n  if (e.customer_email && !EMAIL_RE.test(e.customer_email)) errors.push('customer_email is not a valid e-mail');\n  if (e.status && !ALLOWED_STATUS.includes(e.status)) errors.push(`status must be one of ${ALLOWED_STATUS.join(', ')}`);\n  if (e.currency && !ALLOWED_CURRENCY.includes(e.currency)) errors.push(`currency must be one of ${ALLOWED_CURRENCY.join(', ')}`);\n\n  const dedupeKey = `${String(e.source).toLowerCase()}:${String(e.event_id).toLowerCase()}`;\n  if (errors.length === 0) {\n    if (store.seenKeys.includes(dedupeKey)) {\n      errors.push(`duplicate event (dedupe key ${dedupeKey})`);\n    } else {\n      store.seenKeys.push(dedupeKey);\n      if (store.seenKeys.length > MAX_SEEN) store.seenKeys = store.seenKeys.slice(-MAX_SEEN);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      ...e,\n      dedupe_key: dedupeKey,\n      valid: errors.length === 0,\n      errors,\n    },\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Validate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [520, 120]
    },
